      "body": "Deterministic repro on dev @a93eaeb0dd: `QCHECK_SEED=262311426` fails `Evaluator.Properties.005` every run, on\n\n`typfun ? -> (let y = ({ let 133032.335046 = B; let y = y }) in ?)`\n\nSame class as the original report: the duplicate `y` binder is freshened to `y'` by one engine but not the other. Found while merge-testing autofocus (#2248) and re-verified in a clean worktree at pristine dev, so it is dev-side rather than branch fallout. Could serve as a pinned regression test once the freshening/equality fix lands.",
